{"sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","items":[{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k001","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"췌장 β세포는 포도당 대사로 ATP/ADP 비가 높아지면 KATP 통로가 닫히고 탈분극과 Ca²⁺ 유입으로 insulin을 분비한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k002","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"insulin은 RTK–PI3K–Akt 경로를 통해 골격근·지방세포의 GLUT4 이동을 촉진하고 글리코겐 및 지방 합성을 증가시킨다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k003","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"α세포 glucagon은 간의 cAMP 경로로 글리코겐 분해와 당신생을 촉진한다. δ세포 somatostatin은 주변 내분비 분비를 조절한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k004","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"GLP-1과 GIP는 포도당 의존성 insulin 분비를 촉진하는 incretin이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k005","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"혈중 이온화 Ca²⁺가 감소하면 부갑상샘의 CaSR 신호 감소로 PTH가 증가한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k006","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"PTH는 신장의 Ca²⁺ 재흡수를 증가시키고 인산 재흡수를 감소시키며 1α-hydroxylase를 촉진한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k007","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"활성형 vitamin D(calcitriol)는 장에서 Ca²⁺와 인산 흡수를 증가시킨다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k008","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"뼈에서 PTH는 osteoblast 계열의 RANKL 조절을 통해 osteoclast 형성·활성을 증가시킬 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k009","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"calcitonin은 osteoclast 활성을 억제하지만 성인 인간의 일상적 칼슘 조절에서 PTH/vitamin D보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k010","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"역할이 작다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k011","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"FGF23은 신장 인산 재흡수와 calcitriol 생성을 감소시키는 데 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k012","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"β세포: insulin, α: glucagon, δ: somatostatin.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k013","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"GLUT4는 주로 골격근·지방조직에서 insulin 반응성이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k014","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"PTH: 혈중 Ca²⁺ 상승, 신장 인산 배설 증가.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k015","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"활성 vitamin D는 장 Ca²⁺·인산 흡수를 촉진한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"endocrine--glucose-calcium-k016","sectionId":"endocrine/glucose-calcium","unitId":"endocrine","subject":"biology","text":"감소시켜 인산 배설을 증가시킨다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}